### use this to get auth token
POST https://localhost:7053/api/auth/validate-login
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "AppId" : "biller",
  "Username" : "karen@corporatewebservices.co.za",
  "Password" : "Karen@123",
  "ReturnUrl" : "",
  "RememberMe" : true
}

### Get Tenant by ID
GET https://localhost:7053/api/biller/tenant/1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..L16q_IwJikI4jxonMaMsOLeGYZo71d8dKTWeoV5dQm4

### Get Tenant by User ID
GET https://localhost:7053/api/biller/tenant/foruser/1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..L16q_IwJikI4jxonMaMsOLeGYZo71d8dKTWeoV5dQm4

### Create Tenant
POST https://localhost:7053/api/biller/tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": 0,
  "UserId": "Sample",
  "TierID": "Sample",
  "ContactID": 0,
  "CompanyID": 0,
  "Active": "Sample",
  "Tier": "Sample",
  "Contact": "Sample",
  "Company": "Sample"
}

### Update Tenant
PUT https://localhost:7053/api/biller/tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": 0,
  "UserId": "Sample",
  "TierID": "Sample",
  "ContactID": 0,
  "CompanyID": 0,
  "Active": "Sample",
  "Tier": "Sample",
  "Contact": "Sample",
  "Company": "Sample"
}

### Delete Tenant
DELETE https://localhost:7053/api/biller/tenant/1

